                <pb facs="1012" n="908" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg908"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File. No. 312.52/61.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 17, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Earnestly use your unofficial good offices to secure protection for properties of
                    Spanish subjects who have been expelled from Chihuahua.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
